                            <!--=== Offer Details Wrapper ===-->
                            <div class="offer-details-wrapper">
                                <div class="offer-content">
                                    <div class="content mb-35" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="800">
                                        <h3 class="title">We'll make your stay better!  This September, save a ton of money and receive a free room upgrade.</h3>
                                        <p>Use our incredible offer, which is available just for weekday nights, to get away to peace and quiet at our lowest price to date.  Take advantage of the special amenities included in this package to enhance your stay and feel more comfortable with our flexible cancellation policy.  Get a complimentary accommodation upgrade for stays through October 31, 2025, when you book now through September 20, 2025.  Have a safe and amazing staycation to beat the lockdown blues!</p>
                                        <span>Booking period: Now – 20 September 2025</span>
                                        <span>Stay period: Now – 31 October 2025</span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="content-box mb-35" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1000">
                                        <h3>Hotel Benefits:</h3>
                                        <ul class="check-list style-one">
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Welcome drink upon arrival</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Welcome seasonal fruits in the room upon arrival</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>30% discount on laundry</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>25% discount on room service, food, beverages, and afternoon tea</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Free fast Wi-Fi (speed can be upgraded for webinars and e-games)</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Complimentary canape deluxe set and free access to the Royal Wing pool</li>
                                            <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Complimentary upgrade to next available room type (for mini suites bookings only)</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="content-box mb-35" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-duration="1200">
                                        <h3>Terms and Conditions:</h3>
                                        <ul class="check-list style-two">
                                            <li>Free cancellation 24 hours before the check-in date.</li>
                                            <li>If cancelled within 24 hours before the check-in date, 1 night will be charged.</li>
                                            <li>In case of a no-show, the total amount will be charged</li>
                                            <li>The package benefits are non-transferable and cannot be exchanged for cash.</li>
                                            <li>This offer is valid for stays until 31 October 2021 (last night in-house).</li>
                                        </ul>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
