                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Complementary Airport pickup</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Value for money</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Luxurious rooms for your comfort</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Easy refund on online booking</li>
                                        <li><i class="fas fa-badge-check"></i>Award-winning hotel on TripAdviosr</li>
                                    </ul>
